{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 2, :comments ["<b>He shall make full restitution.</b> In [chapter] המזיק, the Holy One, blessed be He, says: I kindled a fire in Zion, as it is written: ״ויצת אש בציון״, and it is upon Me to make restitution for it — that burning. What is the verse? ״ואני אהיה לה חומת אש סביב״."], :book :exodus, :voice :daat-zkenim, :lang :en, :chapter 22, :notes {0 "The abbreviation ב\"ק is resolved as a reference to the Talmudic chapter המזיק (the first chapter of tractate Bava Kamma), based on the context of the derivation cited there."}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T13:03:52.076209156Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}